            <strong>New battery ID</strong>
            <small>Start a draft passport.</small>
        </a>
        <a class="bp-admin-help-task-card" href="/admin/clusters?tab=data-requirements">
            <span>Define</span>
            <strong>Data requirements</strong>
            <small>Choose required vs optional fields.</small>
        </a>
        <a class="bp-admin-help-task-card" href="/admin/clusters?tab=passports">
            <span>Manage</span>
            <strong>Passport workspace</strong>
            <small>Open drafts, signed, dirty, and published records.</small>
        </a>
        <a class="bp-admin-help-task-card" href="#workflow-steps">
            <span>Learn</span>
            <strong>Step-by-step flow</strong>
